<title>Mexico's cartel violence: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/mexico/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-mexico-2026-11-11T15:29:16.775Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 15:29:16 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Mexican authorities arrested an alleged major leader of the Jalisco New Generation Cartel in Zapopan and seized a cartel cell with DEA assistance. A mayor was found alive after an hours-long abduction. A slain cartel boss known as &amp;quot;The General&amp;quot; is alleged to have supplied fake police identification to Ryan Wedding to facilitate drug trafficking. A police helicopter opened fire on a cartel chase near the U.S. border, killing a 7‑year-old American girl. The conflict recorded 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxOYXhEUmc1OTQzZmZqSU1adTk3UzFDSXBwLXQ0LVJTUkthMlpBQi0yNE40V1hLR0JuNG4wanpOZlIzTlBPMjZlN3lYTkVBbzRyQmVEOVJkcWtvWElJRHJfNE1vanRDcVFnUFlZcjJha0huX2J5clZmZU9HNTdvT2k3VmdWcmZyNHF2MUpSNloyeF9tdUxoOTlqb1pjbW1TSmdVRk1Kbnk5dlBpak96dF9WUGdtcHUtNlpTUnc?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSJ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxNdm41ektmSExKN2ZJOTFlbjE1UEJ0N3lBd1R3WE1OVnB4UzBVaVdrWVRTRWc1ZXFZOXFHU1FpQkVYUnpORURQNVVTdU5WbVgyaTUzaVcwa2dBY1hKRFh3UWRIWk5YZ2xzYWxVUktMNzRWYmdGcTI1MjRjTkpYQk00Q19ES2dFMU5fbVpxWk5obUhaVjRsN3FUSGJHbDd0Vnp3U2dubDRxSFlQNFJJS2c?oc=5&quot;&gt;UA.NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifkFVX3lxTFB6WlNiNS1RdUd5VTNhV3FNRjRNNXJ6Um5CSGNWRGQxVnEzU2o5MldqSFBaRTRkUkpiODc1bDNwbXJ6MFNUaUhiTkJCdUNkXzdsM05tcWk2by1PQUdYZnh0SU93WVphZzdxSVl4WWJKRlgyd3RhaThrMkpmQ1BuUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;CBS News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMieEFVX3lxTE95NXZaV25xTDY4WWY3NGJ0aWtBQ0t5aVduQU8wV0ZiTnJhSTVfMnA0a0VzVjVHUjg5UW5PV0xMRHJnaFZ0UVc2WWdkTHBiQ0Zaa0pMOUp0anNQclBDZHVCU0tnT2xnX2Y1a0RCdDI0aGU5c